me code. Kill path: the admitted request creates the directory and probes the server before the spawn-site refusal, tripping the test's no-directory/no-probe assertions.\",\n642|    ),\n643|    Mutant(\n644|        name=\"N-wiring-lexical\",\n645|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n646|        find='\\tdir, err := lexicalRuntimePath(req.Root, RuntimeDirName, req.Platform)\\n',\n647|        replace='\\tdir, err := lexicalRuntimePath(req.Root, \"ax-tmux\", req.Platform)\\n',\n648|        count=1,\n649|        run=\"TestAcquireOutcomeSocketEqualsSpecPath\",\n650|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n651|        note=\"Admits exactly the renamed leaf at the Acquire lexical site; the outcome socket becomes <root>/ax-tmux/ax.sock on both caller paths. Kill path: the entry-level spec-path test asserts the literal <root>/tmux/ax.sock.\",\n652|    ),\n653|    Mutant(\n654|        name=\"N-wiring-ensure\",\n655|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n656|        find='\\tensured, err := EnsureRuntimeDir(req.Root, RuntimeDirName, req.Platform, nil)\\n',\n657|        replace='\\tensured, err := EnsureRuntimeDir(req.Root, \"ax-tmux\", req.Platform, nil)\\n',\n658|        count=1,\n659|        run=\"TestAcquireOutcomeSocketEqualsSpecPath\",\n660|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n661|        note=\"Admits exactly the renamed leaf at the foreground ensure site: the entry creates <root>/ax-tmux while the socket names <root>/tmux/ax.sock. Kill path: the socket-equality arm in BuildArgv refuses the mismatched pair, failing the foreground leg of the spec-path test.\",\n662|    ),\n663|    Mutant(\n664|        name=\"N-wiring-verify\",\n665|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n666|        find='\\tverr := VerifyRuntimeDir(req.Root, RuntimeDirName, req.Platform)\\n',\n667|        replace='\\tverr := VerifyRuntimeDir(req.Root, \"ax-tmux\", req.Platform)\\n',\n668|        count=1,\n669|        run=\"TestAcquireOutcomeSocketEqualsSpecPath\",\n670|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n671|        note=\"Adm