  replace=\"\\tleafFd, err := unix.Openat(rootFd, name,\\n\\t\\tunix.O_RDONLY|unix.O_NOFOLLOW|unix.O_CLOEXEC, 0)\\n\",\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"(TestEnsureRuntimeDirRefusesNonDirectoryLeaf|TestAcquireForegroundRefusesNonDirectoryLeaf)\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly non-directory leaves past the commit-side O_DIRECTORY arm; O_NOFOLLOW stays, so symlink leaves still refuse, and the verify-side arm carries its own row N-containment-odirectory-verify. Kill path: the 0700 regular file is admitted on Ensure and through the foreground entry (which then probes the server and spawns), and the FIFO stalls past the 5s deadline; the 0600 fixture fails by reroute to the mode gate.\",\n+    ),\n","final_result":true}}}
