{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d315","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c5d0-c246-7b92-beac-dc3b11390997"},"sequence":2021,"recorded_at":1780531400004037,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"aa3bb7a1-c12a-4660-a0d5-ffba7d41ef0c","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"aa3bb7a1-c12a-4660-a0d5-ffba7d41ef0c","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"aa3bb7a1-c12a-4660-a0d5-ffba7d41ef0c"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c5dc-babb-72e0-8343-adf93c154aa9"},"task_id":"01a0c5dc-babb-72e0-8343-adf93c154aa9","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c5dc-babb-72e0-8343-adf93c154aa9","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 6-8\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-## 2026-09-21\n-\n-### TASK-260830-35urbp rev6 — Gate × entry census instrument + broker-wiring, ownership, and session-entry pins\n+## 2026-09-21\n+\n+### TASK-260830-35urbp rev7 — Commit-side O_DIRECTORY pin, WSL2 miss member, catalog-derived decoy completeness\n+\n+- REWORKED after review-verdict-rev6 (CHANGES REQUESTED: no P1, one P2, two P3; trunk unmoved at `799c338`, no refresh; every rev5 finding stays closed with its driven evidence kept — production behaved correctly at every point the review drove, and this revision ships no production change). The census counts reproduce mechanically (24 × 11 = 264 cells; 50 measured / 4 bounds / 210 unreachable) with per-entry kill attribution holding for all 50 measured cells.\n+- P2-A (commit-side O_DIRECTORY arm without a narrowing row): the commit side gets the verify side's fixtures — a 0700 regular-file leaf on `EnsureRuntimeDir` (admit direction) and through foreground `Acquire` (no probe, no spawn), plus a FIFO leaf on `EnsureRuntimeDir` under the shared `verifyWithDeadline` (no-hang) — and shipped row `N-containment-odirectory-commit`, named under row 5 and in the `commit × ENS` / `commit × AFG` census cells; the `N-containment-odirectory-verify` note now points at the commit row instead of asserting it. Under the plant the 0700 leaf is admitted on `Ensure` and through the entry (which probes once and spawns once into `<root>/tmux/ax.sock`) while the FIFO blocks the full 5s.\n+- P3-A (no-fallback miss arm pinned for macOS/Linux only): the Linux miss test is a platform table `{linux, wsl2}`, so `N-creation-literal` and both D rows kill through all three tmux platforms; the WSL2-guarded fallback shape now reddens on the wsl2 member only. P3-B (attestation membership pinned for one decoy of sixteen): the decoy set is derived from `catalog.Current().Capabilities` (Section 4.D, sixteen-value table asserted), every non-realm member alone and all fifteen together refuse at `CheckServerAttested` and through the background miss; `N-realm-membership` keeps its `headless_creation` member with its mask extended to the new tables. Both-spy census is 24/24 by mechanical recount.\n+- Two-sided-gate symmetry check (new instrument run against the census): every gate implemented on two or more sides compared side by side — mode 2/2, O_DIRECTORY 1/1, symlink leaf 1/1, root no-follow 1/1, session 1/1, dispatch 1/1, deps 1/1, probe 1/1, custody wiring 1/1, leaf wiring 1/1/1, details 3/3 members, absence classifier 5/5 members — all symmetric; the O_DIRECTORY commit side was the one this round closed. Optional observations taken: crash-child output captured, `TestBuildArgvRefusesInvalidArgvShape` named under B12, matrix row-46 de-duplicated, `N-details-constructor` note corrected to the typed-nil mechanism.\n+- Battery: 73 narrowing + 2 additive KILLED + control SURVIVED, 76/76 twice with identical verdicts and per-plant raw logs. AC: 58 of 58 rows driven through production entries by named tests (matrix rev7). Full 30-command suite green firsthand; `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go vet` exit 0; tmux-hidden suite 0 skip. Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree.\n+\n+### TASK-260830-35urbp rev6 — Gate × entry census instrument + broker-wiring, ownership, and session-entry pins\n","final_result":true}}}
