rminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"matrix entries: 58 unique: 58 dup: []\\ntrace entries: 58 unique: 58\\nmatrix numbers == 1..58: True\\ncensus rows matrix/trace: 24 24 identical: True\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 145,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 37,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
